{"id":"n910a175a8f","headline":"Opportunity for direct listing on the capital market without an IPO","summary":"The Bangladesh Securities and Exchange Commission approved a draft of direct listing rules for 2026 at its 1027th meeting. The draft will be published for public review.","why":"Direct listings let companies list shares on an exchange without a traditional IPO, which affects capital raising and market depth. Regulatory changes shape investor access to new equities.","category":"markets","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Dhaka","country":"Bangladesh","lat":23.81,"lon":90.412,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"অর্থসূচক","url":"https://www.arthosuchak.com/archives/972185/%E0%A6%86%E0%A6%87%E0%A6%AA%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%93-%E0%A6%9B%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%A1%E0%A6%BC%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%87-%E0%A6%AA%E0%A7%81%E0%A6%81%E0%A6%9C%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%AC%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%9C%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%B0%E0%A7%87/"},"sources":[{"name":"অর্থসূচক","url":"https://www.arthosuchak.com/archives/972185/%E0%A6%86%E0%A6%87%E0%A6%AA%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%93-%E0%A6%9B%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%A1%E0%A6%BC%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%87-%E0%A6%AA%E0%A7%81%E0%A6%81%E0%A6%9C%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%AC%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%9C%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%B0%E0%A7%87/"}],"published_at":"2026-09-01T11:00:36Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T08:34:43Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"1ff44dae6c88b9a9","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-13T08:34:43Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-01T11:00:36Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-01T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"BG","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"আইপিও ছাড়াই পুঁজিবাজারে সরাসরি তালিকাভুক্তির সুযোগ","source_language":"ben","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/stock-mark